%}

### 10. [UNAUTHENTICATED] GET /api/orders - Authentication Required -> Unauthorized (401 Unauthorized)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/orders
Accept: application/json

> {%
    client.test("UNAUTHENTICATED: Access without credentials unauthorized", function() {
        client.assert(response.status === 401, "Expected status code 401");
    });
%}
